    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "capacity_rule": "Chairperson or Vice-Chairperson for the target organization may grant or revoke any Phase 1 capacity; an active acting_officer delegation for either position may act within that organization.",
    "assisted_enrolment_exception": "A platform_enroller may grant only internal_verifier during an active assisted-enrolment session when the representative is present and their decision is recorded.",
